The '''InfiniPot™''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]]. It consumes {{Item|Dungeon Potion}}s in the player's inventory or [[Potion Bag]], and consumes {{Coins}} if the player do not have any selected {{Item|Dungeon Potion}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''InfiniPot™''' can be obtained from the [[Wither Essence Shop]] from {{NPCSprite|Malik}} for {{Item|Wither Essence|amount=5000}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = rare
|special_effect = Upon starting a floor in {{Red|The Catacombs}}, automatically consumes the selected {{Aqua|Dungeon Potion}} from your inventory.<br>If you do not have the selected potion in your inventory, it will be purchased and consumed automatically using {{Gold|Coins}} from your purse or bank.
}}

The '''InfiniPot™''' automatically consumes the selected tier of {{Item|Dungeon Potion}} in the player's inventory upon starting a [[Catacombs]] run. If the player does not have the selected potion in the inventory, they will automatically gain the effect and be deducted the equivalent amount of {{Coins}} instead. This effect can be toggled {{green|'''ON'''}} or {{red|'''OFF'''}}, both in the inventory or in the {{item|Accessory Bag}}.

