== Trivia ==
* The '''InfiniPot™''' was designed by {{RN|MVP++|rembutquaglet}} for the [[Minister Election]].
<!--** {{RN|MVP+|WhamiMC|plus_color=d}} and {{RN|MVP++|NikkyEh|plus_color=f}} contributed to the design of this item.-->
* The mentioned {{NPCSprite|Alixer}}, an NPC that grants potion buffs to {{Gamemode|Bingo}} players, is mentioned in the item's description.
* The {{Coins}} paid for the potions can be reduced by a {{Item|Shady Ring}}, a {{Item|Crooked Artifact}}, or a {{Item|Seal of the Family}}.

